<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 8.6 points to 726.0 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 8.6 points to 726.0 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 8.6 points on Friday to 726.0 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the investment fund index rising the most, up 22.6 points to 1,011.4.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
